howcasing his concept sketches from the book&#x2019;s development(3y(B&#x2014;Back cover.  aIngrambShelf ready books 0aImaginary wars and battlesvFiction. 0aHuman-alien encountersvFiction. 0aMartiansvFiction. 0aMars (Planet)vFiction.1 aRufino, Adam,eartist.  a92bTNT  aPR5774 .W3 2018wAUTOc1i50706010903079f5/21/2025g3lSTACKSmERCp$39.99rYsYtBOOKu4/1/2019xBOOK02115cam  2200445   u538477SIRSI20190330023039.7180412t20182018sp a     bc   000 0 eng d  aYDXbengerdacYDXdMZAdOCLCFdWLUdYDXdNUIdGZMdYDXdFDAdCIAdCNNGCdVP@dSTFdTFWdCRUdAZUdCOD  c$1  a8417047530qhardcover  a9788417047535qhardcover  a(OCoLC)1031205347 4aTR647b.T66 2018  aMAIN1 6880-01aTÂomatsu, ShÂomei,d1930-2012,ephotographer.10aShomei Tomatsu /ccurator, Juan Vicente Aliaga. 1aBarcelona, Spain :bRM Verlag,c[2018] 4c√2018  a270 pages :billustrations (some color) ;c29 cm  atextbtxt2rdacontent  astill imagebsti2rdacontent  aunmediatedbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier  aCatalog of an exhibition at Casa Garriga Nogu‚es, Fundaci‚on MAPFRE, Barcelona from June 5-September 16, 2018.  aIncludes bibliographical references (pages 262-263)00tThe strangeness in the image: On Shomei Tomatsu's photography /rJuan Vicente Alliaga --tShomei Tomatsu, organizer of photographs /rRyuichi Kaneko --tBetween land and sea /rHiromi Kojima --gPortfolio --gChronology ;gSelected bibliography /rCarlos Mart‚in.  aTranslation into English from the Japanese by Andreas Stuhlmann, from the Spanish by Gregory Dechant.  aIngrambShelf ready books106880-02aTÂomatsu, ShÂomei,d1930-2012vExhibitions. 7aExhibition catalogs.1 aAliaga, Juan Vicente,ecurator.1 aStuhlmann, Andreas,etranslator.1 aDechant, Gregory,etranslator.2 aFundaci‚on Mapfre,ehost institution.1 6100-01/$1a$1!D&!D-!Iq!C!(B,d1930-2012,ephotographer.106600-02/$1a$1!D&!D-!Iq!C!(B,d1930-2012vExhibitions.  a92bTNT  aTR647 .T66 20